WEBVTT

1
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Emma C.: First numbers after the email rewrite: calendar connects went from 72% to 79% in one week, on 118 signups.

2
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:07.000
Nathan B.: Seven points in a week is a strong signal, but 118 signups is easy to misread.

3
00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:45.000
Nathan B.: So let's not send it to everyone at once, half first.

4
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:37.000
Emma C.: Fine: the new email two goes to an A/B test on 50% of signups.

5
00:09:10.000 --> 00:09:17.000
Emma C.: Daniel's checklist went live for 20% of users on Monday; too early to read.

6
00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:57.000
Nathan B.: We decide on a 100% rollout after two weeks of data, not before.

7
00:12:58.000 --> 00:13:00.000
Emma C.: Two weeks, agreed.

8
00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:38.000
Emma C.: I'll watch the share of clinics without a first booking after the checklist, for two weeks.
